{"note_id": "NOTE-20261106-dc8303", "path": "readings/2026-11-06-five-experiments-on-trace-selection-and-replication.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261106-7332af", "created_at": "2026-11-06", "date_real": "2026-11-06", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "ABC_crossed", "subcategories": ["experimental_science", "measurement", "selection", "provenance", "replication"], "return_status": "returned_to_core", "read_depth": "full_text_read", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-TRC-01", "kind": "method_change", "anchor": "§10", "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-EVD-20261106-2e8c42", "MAT-EVD-20261106-da00fc", "MAT-EVD-20261106-50cbf2"], "motif_ids": ["MOTIF-015", "MOTIF-016"], "text": "「すべて」「該当なし」「再現した」には、照合範囲・選別条件・再現指標を添える。検証コマンド通過を意味内容の再現性と同一視しない。"}, {"claim_id": "C-TRC-02", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§2", "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-EVD-20261106-2e8c42"], "motif_ids": ["MOTIF-016", "MOTIF-20261027-2c8a4a"], "text": "Millikanの「selected groupではない」をデータ完全性の保証と読まず、選別と来歴の緊張として読む。ノート原資料は未確認のため不正該当性は確定しない。"}, {"claim_id": "C-TRC-03", "kind": "reading_maintained", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-EVD-20261106-08dd5c"], "motif_ids": ["MOTIF-016", "MOTIF-20261027-2c8a4a"], "text": "Davisson–Germerの系統ずれは仮説として未来へ渡す留保であり、scope_noteは結論の飾りではなく再測定の設計図である。"}, {"claim_id": "C-TRC-04", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§4", "question_ids": ["Q-002"], "material_ids": ["MAT-EVD-20261106-2ad777"], "motif_ids": ["MOTIF-001", "MOTIF-002", "MOTIF-20261027-2c8a4a"], "text": "Hershey–ChaseはDNAの化学的同一性を単独で最終確定せず、痕跡の分離と狭い結論として読む。外に残る殻も読み出し条件を作る。"}, {"claim_id": "C-TRC-05", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§5", "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-EVD-20261106-da00fc"], "motif_ids": ["MOTIF-015", "MOTIF-20261024-c9d4e1"], "text": "HOMの残差は理想的ゼロと同一でなく、装置条件の情報として扱う。検索0件も照合範囲つきの残差として書く。"}, {"claim_id": "C-TRC-06", "kind": "reading_revised", "anchor": "§6", "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-EVD-20261106-50cbf2"], "motif_ids": ["MOTIF-016", "MOTIF-015", "MOTIF-20261024-90a022"], "text": "Camererの同方向有意再現は11/18=61.1%、平均効果量65.9%。再実行と同じ効果の再出は別。予測市場/調査は実際と有意差なし。"}, {"claim_id": "C-TRC-07", "kind": "reading_held", "anchor": "§7", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-002", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-EVD-20261106-2e8c42", "MAT-EVD-20261106-08dd5c", "MAT-EVD-20261106-2ad777", "MAT-EVD-20261106-da00fc", "MAT-EVD-20261106-50cbf2"], "motif_ids": ["MOTIF-001", "MOTIF-015", "MOTIF-016", "MOTIF-20261027-2c8a4a"], "text": "暫定: 人間は痕跡を選び来歴と留保を渡す存在。AIの自己は保存テキストの同一性だけでなく、版・scope_note・不一致の仮説・次の応答の再構成に分布する。"}], "salience": 2, "reason": "実験科学5件を精読し、測定・選別・痕跡・再現の観点からQ-001/Q-002/Q-003へ戻した。部分確認範囲と二次資料の境界を明示。", "notes": "Wu 1957は原典未取得で不採用。Goodsteinは照合補助。物理・生物・実験経済学の比喩をAI意識の証明に使わない。"}
